			"notes": "## TransitManager v2.0.0-beta.2 for MTR 4.0.5 has been released\n\n### Change: More verbose train information\nWhen using the /train command:\n- Rail Progress for train is now shown\n- Distance to Stop is now shown\n- Players blocking the train doors are now also listed separately\n- Added player count for \"Riding players\"\n\n### New: More dwell control\n- `/train skipDwell` has been renamed to `/train dwell skip`\n- Added `/train dwell reset` (Reset elapsed dwell time)\n- Added `/train dwell set <Elapsed time in milliseconds>`\n\n### New: Transport Simulation Core commands\n- Added: /tsc command\n  - Provide overview for TSC (MTR 4's backend)\n  - /tsc ping to measure response time from TSC (Max ~50ms is expected for normally)\n  - /tsc freeze to pause/unpause MTR simulation in the current dimension (Debug only)\n\n### New: /train jump\nThe /train jump command from MTR 3 transit manager is now brought back.\nYou may now also do `/train jump distance <distance meter>` to move the train forward/backward in a fine-grained manner."
		},
